{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract lookup [-h] [--rsid RSID | --gene GENE] [--locus LOCUS] [--sample SAMPLE]\n                         [--gvcf GVCF] [--report REPORT] [--build {GRCh37,GRCh38,CHM13v2.0}]\n                         [--limit LIMIT] [--cursor CURSOR] [--help-all]\n\nGenotype and evidence at an rsID, locus or gene, with report findings.\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --rsid RSID           dbSNP rsID, e.g. rs429358 (merged IDs follow dbSNP build 157).\n  --gene GENE           Gene symbol or alias (NCBI RefSeq), e.g. APOE: its calls and evidence,\n                        paged by --limit.\n  --locus LOCUS         BUILD:CHROM:POS[-END][:REF>ALT], e.g. GRCh38:chr19:44908684:T>C; with\n                        --rsid or --gene, chooses one of several placements.\n  --sample SAMPLE       Sample of a multi-sample VCF (required for one).\n  --gvcf GVCF           The sample's gVCF, if not the input or recorded by its run.\n  --report REPORT       Personal report JSON (or its folder) to join (default: the one in the\n                        input's folder).\n  --build {GRCh37,GRCh38,CHM13v2.0}\n                        The input's build when its header doesn't show it.\n  --limit LIMIT         Calls per page of a gene or region (1-1000; default 50).\n  --cursor CURSOR       next_cursor of the previous page.\n  --help-all            Show this help with the advanced options too, and exit.\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\n2 advanced options not shown; 'wgsextract lookup --help-all' lists them.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract lookup --input sample.vcf.gz --rsid rs429358\n  wgsextract lookup --input sample.vcf.gz --locus GRCh38:chr19:44908684:T>C\n  wgsextract lookup --input sample.vcf.gz --gene APOE --json\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  Prints the genotype, evidence state and report findings; writes no files\n  (--json: the wgsextract.lookup/1 document in details).\n\nneeds:\n  no external tools; depending on options and inputs, also: bcftools; seconds\n  from existing results.\n",
